hey welcome to a new project camp update  so we bought a piece of land and are  prototyping a more sustainable way of  living  let's see how that's gonna go and in the  last update you saw the containers we  built  arriving in portugal and in today's  update we're actually going to  clean the land so the containers can  come  so here we have the base camp installed  on this grass patch  and i want to clear up the bushes that  are around here  to put the containers so they can really  put them in front of the trees right  there  so basically clean up this area right  here but let me put on a time lapse and  get started  [Music]  i mean i have to admit after a while of  wrestling with these bushes  i really just started to develop some  hate towards these thorns  i mean at this point i got thorns in my  hands socks and even my butt  it got personal so sometimes when you're  taking this down  you see a few very thick strings that  are the root of  many others so if you kill them the  whole bush is gonna die  yeah feels so good to kill  nature and after continuing for a while  the thorns and bushes were flattened  down  but not really flat flat i needed  something really heavy to flatten it  so there was really only one thing i  could think of to do next  [Music]  and after everything was really flat it  was time to take it out  [Applause]  take out all the thorns i've never seen  so many thorns in my life  but also taking out the bushes and roots  that come with it  and it's kind of boring to do and the  only real motivation i had was  that while we're cleaning we're making  this big pile of thorns  and next we're gonna put those massive  piles on fire  watch them burn so once we took  everything out  yeah and this stuff burned surprisingly  well and fast  even when we just took it out and is  still fresh and wet  and this is actually one of the reasons  it's important to keep land like this  clean from these bushes  especially in the summer it can get  really dry and these easily catch fire  so generally everyone here is very happy  when you remove thorns  so this smoke is a little celebration  although i'm not sure if the neighbors  would agree with that  so now the whole area is clean but we  still need to make some floor spaces for  the container  and while working on this i broke the  tool  i broke the tool the wooden part broke  from the metal part  but we don't really have many tools  around to repair things with  but luckily simple tools require simple  fixes  so i could manage to fix this thing  using a rock as a hammer and continue to  work  so we cut it uh the spaces for the  container but they're not very flat  yet uh so i'm gonna level them uh to  make sure  all the soil is straight and the  container is water  water balanced how do you say that in  english  so  time to do some digging  so the leveling itself is pretty  straightforward just moving a lot of  soil from one place to another  as you can see here in this corner  there's quite a height difference  there's like  34 centimeters difference in  leveling height and after the rough  leveling work is done  i did it a bit more refined and now the  main leveling work is done  but the soil itself is still very loose  you kind of want to press it a bit but  just me and my boots didn't really do  the job  i needed something more heavy  so the area is now pretty leveled the  van is flat however  the van isn't really the exact same  thing as a container it's like three  thousand kilo versus  six thousand kilogram so it might still  move a bit  when we actually put it down onto the  soil  so i want to find some pieces of wood or  stone that while we put it here with the  crane  we can actually make sure to balance it  really precise and accurately  um so yeah we need to go to the  warehouse and the warehouse is basically  situated right in the middle of the land  and it's kind of like a shop or a  material bank  they just have so many valuable things  so yeah here let me show you you look at  this  warehouse it has wooden beams  it has roof tiles it has wooden beams  and roof tiles  in that corner they also have some  wooden beams and some roof tiles  you can really find anything basically  in this warehouse  and it's all free  so this shot actually burned down during  the fire and the roof collapsed  here you can still see traces of that  but  within this burnt wood you can still  find good wood as well  so the land is now ready the workspace  container can come  right here there where i am waving  and the kitchen container is coming  right there where the van is now parked  so now we just have to wait all right so  that was it  the land is now all cleared uh ready for  the containers to arrive  but as you might have seen in the  previous update we just have to wait for  the municipality to clean the road  that the containers can actually come if  you want to see that update and all the  other updates have a look here  if you want to see how it's going to go  next make sure to subscribe  so we release a new update video when  it's time  and if you want to make sure we can pay  the guy with a crane to come here to  drop off the container  make sure to visit  support.projectcamp.com to see how you  can help out  thanks for watching see you in the next  update
 

